# Line-ending policy (DECISIONS D16): every text file is LF in the repository
# AND in the working tree, on every platform. Prettier and the CI runners
# assume LF; letting core.autocrlf smudge CRLF into checkouts turns formatting
# checks red on Windows (observed at Gate 5).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows scripts that genuinely require CRLF
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf

# Binaries, never converted
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
